@startuml
title Transfer journey: one P2P transfer, hop by hop (H1-H31)

' Solid arrows are HTTP, dashed arrows are Kafka

participant "pinebank\ncore" as CB
participant "pinebank\nSDK" as PS
boundary "ALS" as ALS
database "Oracle" as OR
boundary "quoting-service" as QS
boundary "ml-api-adapter\nAPI" as MA
collections "Kafka" as K
control "prepare\nhandler" as PH
control "position-batch\nhandler" as POS
control "fulfil\nhandler" as FH
control "notification\nhandler" as NH
participant "riverwallet\nSDK" as RS
participant "riverwallet\ncore" as RB

== Phase 1: Discovery ==
CB -> PS: [H1] POST /transfers (SDK outbound API)
PS -> ALS: [H2] GET /parties/MSISDN/{ID}
ALS -> OR: [H3] GET /participants/MSISDN/{ID}
ALS -> RS: [H4] GET /parties/MSISDN/{ID}
RS -> RB: [H5] GET /parties/MSISDN/{ID}
RS -> ALS: [H6] PUT /parties/MSISDN/{ID}
ALS -> PS: [H7] PUT /parties/MSISDN/{ID}
note over PS: [H8] payee resolved

== Phase 2: Quote ==
PS -> QS: [H9] POST /quotes
QS --> K: [H10] topic-quotes-post
QS -> RS: [H11] POST /quotes
RS -> RB: [H12] POST /quoterequests
note over RS: ILP packet, condition, fulfilment
RS -> QS: [H13] PUT /quotes/{ID}
QS --> K: [H14] topic-quotes-put
QS -> PS: [H15] PUT /quotes/{ID}

== Phase 3: Transfer prepare ==
PS -> MA: [H16] POST /transfers
MA --> K: [H17] topic-transfer-prepare
K --> PH: consume
PH --> K: [H18] topic-transfer-position-batch\n(key = payer position account)
K --> POS: [H19] consume
note over POS: [H20] RESERVE
POS --> K: [H21] topic-notification-event (prepare)
K --> NH: consume
NH -> RS: [H22] POST /transfers
RS -> RB: [H23] POST /transfers

== Phase 3: Transfer fulfil and commit ==
RS -> MA: [H24] PUT /transfers/{ID} (fulfilment)
MA --> K: [H25] topic-transfer-fulfil
K --> FH: consume
FH --> K: [H26] topic-transfer-position-batch\n(key = payee position account)
K --> POS: [H27] consume
note over POS: [H28] COMMIT
POS --> K: [H29] topic-notification-event (commit)
K --> NH: consume
NH -> PS: [H30] PUT /transfers/{ID}
PS -> CB: [H30] response to H1
NH -> RS: [H31] PUT or PATCH /transfers/{ID}
@enduml
